------------------------------------------------------------------------

Reproducer:
  CARGO_TARGET_DIR=$HOME/work/zen/jxl-encoder-shared-target \
    cargo run --release -p jxl-encoder \
    --features 'butteraugli-loop ssim2-loop parallel __expert' \
    --example w44_168_adaptive_iters \
    > benchmarks/w44_168_adaptive_iters_2026-05-21.tsv

Cells (36 total × 4 modes paired interleaved A/B/C/D):
  - TARGET_SMOOTH_PHOTO (1418519 + 7552578 × e{7,8,9} × d{3,4,5}): 18 cells
    Note: 2 cells (1418519 e8/e9 d=5) re-classified
    TARGET_SMOOTH_PHOTO_or_PROTECT_W166 in the bench output to avoid
    double-counting in the aggregator.
  - TARGET_TEXTURED (1189261 + 1420710 × e{7} × d{1, 1.5, 2}): 6 cells
  - PROTECT_W164_screenshots (codec_wiki + imac_g3 + terminal × e{5,6}): 6 cells
  - PROTECT_W166_1418519_d6 (1418519 × e{8,9} × d=6): 2 cells
  - CONTROL (1025469 × e{7,8} × d{4}): 2 cells

